# Keep secrets, local environments and build output out of every image.
# Patterns match from the build-context root, so **/ is needed to catch .env files in
# subfolders too (Vite reads web/.env, and web.Dockerfile copies web/).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
**/__pycache__
node_modules
web/node_modules
web/dist
.claude/worktrees
*.dump
data/dumps
